{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "寝言を録音してくれるアプリにハマってます。\n岡本姫奈です。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "朝起きるのがちょっとだけ楽しみになりました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ハッキリとした寝言が録れたら\nトークで送るね😂"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近はね〜毎日バースデーライブに向けて練習頑張ってるよ💪🏻"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大きな会場を用意していただけること。\n絶対に当たり前じゃなくて。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ファンの皆さんと先輩方が繋いできてくださった歴史を。\n14回目のバースデーを皆さんとお祝い出来たら嬉しいです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "平日ではありますが\n今の乃木坂46に。\n私たち会いに来てください。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "🔗https://ticket.rakuten.co.jp/music/rtzpbdh/"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "特別な3日間にしようね。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mobI1OeTv.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "待ってます‪🧸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして！先日の京都リアルミーグリ！\n会いに来てくれて本当にありがとう☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mobt3jE2W.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この日はレースでいっぱいのワンピース着たよ〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "#ひなのクローゼット\n⬆️私服のハッシュタグが出来たので これからも沢山投稿していくね👗"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おしゃれして来てくれたり、\n髪の毛可愛くしてきてくれたり、\n名札作ってきてくたり、\n生誕Tシャツ着てくれてたり。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜーんぶ気づいてるよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんなへの愛がより深くなっちゃった1日でした🤭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そしてお花も！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mobkvOUgF.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつもレーンをこんなに可愛く彩ってくれるファンの皆さんに ありがとうの気持ちでいっぱいです😭😭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mob5fxgk7.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "レイヤーカットも好評で嬉しかった。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また会える日が待ち遠しいです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202605/mobLvrdBV.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "カメラ構えたら 入ってきてくれる\n愛おしい子達。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでいただきありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またすぐ書きます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本日の一曲 BRAVE GROOVE/ iLiFE!さん"}], "source": "official"}